From 159666873d8056ffc379e5fff783e76fdc82ab63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: racheltong29 <racheltong29@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 20:33:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Apply eval harness patches + add timing instrumentation

Patches (previously documented in UPSTREAM_PATCHES.md):
- infer_multiview.py, infer_paint.py: absolute python/blender paths,
  avoid PATH/version drift in os.system subprocess shells
- differentiable_renderer/voronoi.py: fix for our CUDA env
- scripts/blender_bake.py: GLB export compat fix
- scripts/remesh_reduce_blender_script.py: bpy trimesh fallback +
  fix missing fast-simplification dep (root cause of 10-asset timeout)

New instrumentation scripts:
- infer_paint_timed.py: per-stage wall-clock timing for stage 3
- mvpainter/bake_pipeline_timed.py: per-substep timing inside call_bake
  (showed xatlas UV-unwrap was 99% of bake time on undecimated meshes)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
